ect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Move the words from the box to correctly complete the sentences.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 10, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "correct": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1, "correct": 1, "selected": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn11le13ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le13ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn11le13ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn11le13ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "If you hear the phrase, \u201cBe the change\u201d, how will you respond? Will you be curious and try to find out what it means? I just recently learned about this movement and I will tell you about it and how you can become involved. The full quote is \u201cYou must be the change you want to be in the world\u201d and it was widely said by Mahatma Gandhi. A woman wanted Gandhi to talk to her young son about eating too much sugar. Gandhi said, \u201cIf you come back in two weeks, I will talk to your son.\" She was confused but she complied.</p>", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn11le13ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "Two weeks later the boy and his mother returned. Gandhi talked to the boy about working to eliminate sweets. The mother asked why he had asked them to return after two weeks. He said he could not speak to her son about not eating sugar until he himself had taken that journey. So the message is, if you have experience in making a change, you will be able to spur others on to make change.</p>", "id": 2, "time": "30000"}, {"image": "engenn11le13ob02re2img02.jpg", "text": "There is now a <span class=\"italic\">Be the Change</span> movement inspired by the words and actions of Gandhi. There is a lot of violence, pollution, poverty, addiction, oppression and war in the world. If you want to get involved in making the world a better place, <span class=\"italic\">Be the Change</span> will provide a clear and powerful way to be a part of the change you wish to see. The movement challenges its members to commit to doing at least one intentional positive act of change each day for the benefit of others. If we all do one positive thing each day, the world will be a much happier place! Will you accept the challenge?</p>It sounds easy but I know I have lots of days when I don't feel like helping anyone. However, the act could even be singing, dancing or exercising. If you improve yourself, you improve the world. Tomorrow, I will make a commitment to be the change. I will find one way to bring more light into the world. Will you join me?", "id": 3, "time": "51000"}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Good Deeds", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Be the Change", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 13, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Express duty, advice, willingness, or intention to do something in spoken or written texts and in work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands extended speeches, lectures, articles and reports of the professional, academic, or daily life on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about social issues.", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "engenn11le13ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Will for Willingness and Intention", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">will </span> most often to talk about the future. However, <span class=\"italic\">will</span> has also other functions which include showing willingness, unwillingness, and intention.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">will </span>to show that somebody is willing/unwilling  to do something. <br /> Example:  <br /> <span class=\"italic\">Richard is a nice person. He<span class=\"strong\"> will </span>always help you if you are in trouble. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">will not </span>or <span class=\"strong\">won't </span>to  show unwillingness to do something. <br />Example: <br /><span class=\"italic\"> Robert is mad at me. He <span class=\"strong\">will not </span>answer the phone. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You also use <span class=\"strong\">will </span>to express intention.  <br /> Example:  <br /> <span class=\"italic\">Come on, I <span class=\"strong\">will </span>help you with the project. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Will you be curious and try to find out what it means?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I will tell you about it and how you can become involved.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Will you accept the challenge? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I will make a commitment to be the change.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I will find one way to bring more light into the world.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "How to Form the First Conditional", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the<span class=\"strong\"> first conditional</span> to talk about real possibilities in the present or future. As with other conditional grammar structures, the form can be quite complicated. Let's take a look at how to structure a <span class=\"strong\">first conditional </span>sentence.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"If\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">it snows,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'll stay at home.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Notice that you are using the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Present</span> in the condition clause, even though you are referring to the future. You use <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">will</span> + verb</span> to talk about the possible future result.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure of the first conditional is:<br/><span class=\"italic\">If</span> + Simple Present, + <span class=\"italic\">will</span> + base verb", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Notice that you use a comma after the condition clause. If you start the sentence with the result clause, then you do not have to use a comma.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">I'll stay at home</span> if it snows.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If you hear the phrase, \u201cBe the change\u201d, how will you respond?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If you come back in two weeks, I will talk to your son. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If you have experience in making a change, you will be able to spur others on to make change. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If you want to get involved in making the world a better place, Be the Change will provide a clear and powerful way to be a part of the change you wish to see.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If we all do one positive thing each day, the world will be a much happier place!", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "poverty ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the state of having little to live on", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is a lot of violence, pollution, poverty, addiction, oppression and war in the world.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le13ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "oppression ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "unjust treatment", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Many people in the world experience oppression.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le13ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "intentional ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "deliberate; on purpose", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Your actions toward others should be intentional and thoughtful.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le13ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "movement ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a group of people working together for a cause", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The movement challenges its members to commit to doing at least one intentional positive act of change each day for the benefit of others. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le13ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to spur ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to encourage", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If you have experience in making a change, you will be able to spur others on to make change. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le13ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to comply", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to do as asked", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She was confused but she complied.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le13ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "With a partner, make a list of ways that you can be the change you want to see in your city or country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write an e-mail to a friend explaining how they can help be the change in their community.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Exchange your e-mail with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Correct errors in your partner's e-mail or make suggestions to make it better.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Rewrite your e-mail taking into account your partner's suggestions.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I make a list of ways to be the change in my country or city.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write an e-mail about ways a friend can be the change.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I suggest corrections to my partner's e-mail.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I rewrite my e-mail with my partner's suggestions.", "type": "text"}]}]}